      "created_at": "2023-11-20T17:36:57Z",
      "updated_at": "2023-11-20T17:36:57Z",
      "body": "I assume we can do something.\r\n\r\nWe can add:\r\n```\r\n    static ossl_unused ossl_inline LHASH_OF(type) * \\\r\n    lh_##type##_new_ex(OPENSSL_LH_HASHFUNC hfn, \\\r\n                    OPENSSL_LH_COMPFUNC cfn) \\\r\n    { \\\r\n        return (LHASH_OF(type) *) \\\r\n            OPENSSL_LH_new(hfn, cfn); \\\r\n    } \\\r\n```\r\nAnd use the _ex function throughout. And for the hashfunc and compfunc type safety we can use the IMPLEMENT_LHASH_HASH_FN() IMPLEMENT_LHASH_COMP_FN() macros over the existing hash and comp functions.\r\n",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
